{
 "_description": "Reviewed mapping from Terraform AWS provider resource types to aws_core entity types where the names differ. Several Terraform resources may map to one of our types (the provider splits one AWS resource over several: S3 bucket settings, security group rules, file systems); their attributes are merged for the comparison. An empty list is a reviewed gap: the Terraform resource looks like one of ours by name but is not the same thing. A Terraform resource in neither this map nor name-matched (strip aws_core__aws_ and aws_, compare lower-case alphanumerics) is not compared. Terraform is a reference, not ground truth; every entry is a first judgement from names and the schema, to be corrected when a pair's report shows it is wrong. Each entry is checked against the schema dump and the plugin's types by the tests and by every run.",
